{33}{Me?  I'm a historian...I study our dwarven past, reflect on the paths we have taken, collect objects of historical relevance and value.  [You almost see him smile.]  When I can, I try to tell our story and tell it true...I can only hope to be a looking glass into the dwarven soul...}{Me?  I'm a historian...I study our dwarven past, reflect on the paths we have taken, collect objects of historical relevance and value.  [You almost see him smile.]  When I can, I try to tell our story and tell it true...I can only hope to be a looking glass into the dwarven soul...}{}{}{}{}
