{40}{Currently, I'm studying dwarven legends and mythology.  And recently, I came across something very interesting...very interesting indeed...[He seems lost in thought.]}{Well...I've many suppliers.  We trade often in Stillwater when the need arises.  But, just lately, I've run out of mithril.  If you know anything about the metal, you know that its rare.  I'm having trouble finding a new source, and many of my objects are incomplete without it...}{}{}{}{}
{41}{What Erick?  What is it you found..?}{}{5}{}{46}{}
