{44}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{46}{[He shakes his head.]  Sorry about that...the possibilities are so exciting...perhaps I should be more forthcoming.  Dwarven mythology tells of an ancient race of dwarves, whose civilization was filled with such wonders as the world has never known before or since.  They were known as the Iron Clan...}{[He shakes his head.]  Sorry about that...the possibilities are so exciting...perhaps I should be more forthcoming.  Dwarven mythology tells of an ancient race of dwarves, whose civilization was filled with such wonders as the world has never known before or since.  They were known as the Iron Clan...}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
{47}{The Iron Clan?  Were they real?  What happened to them?}{}{5}{}{54}{}
{49}{Uh...where Iron Clan?}{}{-4}{}{54}{}
{50}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{54}{Well, no one really knows if they were real, or what happened to them if they were, because we've found no proof of their existence.  BUT!  One of our miners dug up an old dwarven mace a few weeks ago...the handle of that axe was hollow, and within it was this...[He shows you what looks to be an old schematic.]}{Well, no one really knows if they were real, or what happened to them if they were, because we've found no proof of their existence.  BUT!  One of our miners dug up an old dwarven mace a few weeks ago...the handle of that axe was hollow, and within it was this...[He shows you what looks to be an old schematic.]}{}{}{}{}
{55}{What is it, Erick?}{}{5}{}{94}{}
