{60}{It looks to be the schematic for a key.  There is some text on here which seems to hint that it is the first of many keys, keys which open the 'Place of Iron where lies the Stone'...do you know what that could mean?}{It looks to be the schematic for a key.  There is some text on here which seems to hint that it is the first of many keys, keys which open the 'Place of Iron where lies the Stone'...do you know what that could mean?}{}{}{}{}
{61}{No...what?  What does it mean?}{}{5}{}{64}{}
