{64}{The 'Stone' that it refers to could be the famed Durin Stone, upon which the dwarven philosophy of the Shape and the Stone is purportedly carved!  The recovery of such an object would be invaluable for the dwarven race--an unparalleled discovery reflecting our culture and history...}{The 'Stone' that it refers to could be the famed Durin Stone, upon which the dwarven philosophy of the Shape and the Stone is purportedly carved!  The recovery of such an object would be invaluable for the dwarven race--an unparalleled discovery reflecting our culture and history...}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
