{94}{Yes...I suppose it does no harm.  I've a copy of the schematic, so if you cannot find the 'Place of Iron', I could always go looking myself.  And if you do find it, and the Durin Stone is there, bring it to me...it would be worthless to anyone but a dwarf, and most precious to me.  I'd have nothing to offer but my thanks...I'm afraid a historian has little in worldly goods...}{Yes...I suppose it does no harm.  I've a copy of the schematic, so if you cannot find the 'Place of Iron', I could always go looking myself.  And if you do find it, and the Durin Stone is there, bring it to me...it would be worthless to anyone but a dwarf, and most precious to me.  I'd have nothing to offer but my thanks...I'm afraid a historian has little in worldly goods...}{}{}{}{qu1093 1}
