{125}{You have!  My god!  I never dreamed, I mean they were real...the Stone...its beautiful.  [He is silent for a long time, turning the stone over in his hands.]  And what of the Iron Clan?  What did you see?}{You have!  My god!  I never dreamed, I mean they were real...the Stone...its beautiful.  [He is silent for a long time, turning the stone over in his hands.]  And what of the Iron Clan?  What did you see?}{}{}{}{qu1093 4}
