{128}{Its more than I ever hoped or dreamed.  It seems they truly were advanced, far beyond what anyone could have known.  I so look forward to visiting the caverns of the Iron Clan, and learning of their ways. Thank you, my friend.  You've no idea the gift you've bestowed on us all...}{Its more than I ever hoped or dreamed.  It seems they truly were advanced, far beyond what anyone could have known.  I so look forward to visiting the caverns of the Iron Clan, and learning of their ways. Thank you, my friend.  You've no idea the gift you've bestowed on us all...}{}{}{}{}
